{"type":"message","id":"76cc1e0c","parentId":"ee6a6a53","timestamp":"2026-02-17T17:06:45.612Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_feeac4faa01f41f2befa8704","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Dedicated Model Assignment Plan for OpenClaw Agents\n\n**Date**: 2025-02-17\n**Current Setup**: All agents use `openrouter/stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free`\n**Goal**: Tailor models per agent based on specialization, cost, and capability needs\n\n---\n\n## 1. Agent Assessment & Capability Requirements\n\n### Coder Agent\n**Primary Functions**:\n- Code generation (multiple languages)\n- Debugging and error analysis\n- Code review and optimization\n- Architecture planning\n- Documentation generation\n\n**Critical Capabilities Needed**:\n- **Large context window** (8K-128K tokens): For reading full codebases, project files, documentation\n- **Strong reasoning**: Logical problem-solving, algorithmic thinking\n- **Code comprehension**: Understanding complex code patterns, dependencies\n- **Speed**: Reasonable response time for iterative development\n- **Cost sensitivity**: Development may involve many API calls; balance quality with cost\n\n### Social Media Agent\n**Primary Functions**:\n- Content creation (posts, tweets, captions)\n- Tone/style adaptation (platform-specific: Twitter/X, Discord, WhatsApp, etc.)\n- Engagement response drafting\n- Hashtag and keyword optimization\n- Multimodal content description (when images provided)\n\n**Critical Capabilities Needed**:\n- **Creative writing**: Natural, engaging language\n- **Style flexibility**: Adapt tone for different platforms/audiences\n- **Moderate reasoning**: Understanding context, brand voice\n- **Multimodal awareness** (optional): Image understanding for captions/descriptions\n- **Speed**: Quick generation for real-time engagement\n- **Cost-effective**: High volume of content; free/low-cost preferred\n\n### OSINT Analyst Agent\n**Primary Functions**:\n- Web research and information gathering\n- 