{"type":"message","id":"0d49c1bd","parentId":"76cc1e0c","timestamp":"2026-02-17T17:06:58.218Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! The file has been created successfully with all 10 sections. Let me provide a summary to the user about what I've delivered.\n\nThe plan is comprehensive and includes:\n1. **Assessment** - detailed analysis of each agent's needs\n2. **Model Recommendations** - specific models with reasoning\n3. **Configuration Changes** - exact JSON structure and examples\n4. **Migration Steps** - phased approach with timeline\n5. **Cost Tracking** - implementation options and spreadsheet template\n6. **Risks & Mitigations** - 7 major risks with specific mitigation strategies\n7. **Timeline Summary** - 3-4 week rollout plan\n8. **Configuration Quick Reference** - final JSON example\n9. **Post-Migration Checklist** - verification items\n10. **Conclusion & Recommendations** - summary and next steps\n\nThe plan is actionable, includes specific models, configuration snippets, timelines, and risk mitigation strategies as requested.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I've created a comprehensive plan for assigning dedicated models to each OpenClaw agent type. The plan is now saved as `agent-model-assignment-plan.md` in your workspace.\n\n## Plan Summary\n\nThe plan covers all requested sections in a structured, actionable format:\n\n### **Key Recommendations:**\n\n| Agent | Recommended Model | Why |\n|-------|------------------|-----|\n| **Coder** | Claude 3.5 Sonnet | Best code quality, 200K context, strong reasoning |\n| **Social** | GPT-4o Mini | Creative, fast, multimodal, cost-effective |\n| **OSINT** | Claude 3.5 Sonnet | Superior reasoning, accuracy, fact-checking |\n| **Generalist** | Step-3.5 Flash | Fast, free, adequate versatility |\n\nAll models sourced through **OpenRouter** for unified API access and free tier availability.\n\n### **Risk Mitigation Highlights:**\n\n- **Pe